k2 inbox [<subcommand>] [options]

The workspace's email-like communication channel. Items arrive from
other workspaces (via `k2 msg --inbox-wake|--inbox-silent`) or are
composed by your own agent (via `k2 inbox compose`). Read, triage, file into folders.

